# TensorFlow/Keras CPU experiments are isolated from PyTorch and finance ABI.
# tensorflow without [and-cuda] is upstream's CPU installation. Use one
# tensorflow distribution: tf-keras depends on it, so tensorflow-cpu plus
# tf-keras would install two distributions over the same tensorflow namespace.
# TFP 0.25 is tested against TF 2.18 and explicitly requires legacy tf-keras.
